# Project Charter

## Project Name

Sales Performance Analytics Dashboard

## Company

ABC Retail Corporation

## Domain

Retail Sales Analytics

## Role

Sales Data Analyst

## Project Duration

2 Weeks

## Project Background

ABC Retail Corporation operates multiple retail stores across the United States, offering products in Furniture, Office Supplies, and Technology categories.

The Sales team currently prepares monthly sales reports manually using Excel spreadsheets. This process is time-consuming, prone to errors, and makes it difficult to monitor business performance.

To improve reporting efficiency and support data-driven decision-making, management requested an interactive Power BI dashboard that provides real-time visibility into sales performance, profitability, customer trends, and regional performance.

## Business Goal

Develop an executive sales dashboard that enables management to monitor KPIs, identify business opportunities, and make informed strategic decisions.

## Expected Outcome

• Centralized sales reporting

• Improved decision-making

• Reduced manual reporting effort

• Better visibility into regional and product performance

• Executive-level KPI dashboard
